+# Perf history
+
+## Real transcript ingest
+
+No measured figures are available. There is a smoke test
+(`crates/muninn-capture/src/lib.rs`, `smoke::parses_real_transcripts_when_present`)
+that, when run on a machine with a real Claude Code transcript at
+`~/.claude/projects/-home-ilien-Projects-muninn/*.jsonl`, parses it and prints
+turn/episode/tool counts to stderr — but it does not measure or record
+transcript size, wall-clock ingest time, or persist its output anywhere. No
+run of that test, benchmark log, or CI artifact with real numbers was found
+in this repository or session. Size in MB, turn/episode counts, and ingest
+duration for a real transcript are therefore not recorded here; fill this
+section in from an actual measured run rather than estimating.
